{"version":1,"content":"<p>國際科研團隊近日宣佈取得一項重要考古學突破。他們首次成功從洞穴牆壁中提取出保存數千年的古代人類DNA，證明即使沒有壁畫或其他明顯的人類活動痕跡，洞穴巖壁依然可能保存着遠古訪客留下的遺傳信息。這一發現為研究史前人類活動提供了全新的途徑，也可能幫助科學家在不破壞考古遺址的情況下了解古人類的身份和活動方式。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583572.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.741992+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:36:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_hash":"9b3341c929a5e5993e61db157be7a5d9ce5655b9744d8280e6e19d8d4516f029","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}